    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25em;margin-bottom:12px;\">Four business values</div><p>Many business values can result in <strong>31</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p>Senior managers need to understand and deal with the potential <strong>32</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> that may result.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Collaboration</p><p>During a training course, the speaker was in a team that had to build a <strong>33</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p>Other teams experienced <strong>34</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> from trying to collaborate.</p><p>The speaker&rsquo;s team won because they reduced collaboration</p><p>Sales of a <strong>35</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> were poor because of collaboration.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Industriousness</p><p>Hard work may be a bad use of various company <strong>36</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p>The word &lsquo;lazy&rsquo; in this context refers to people who avoid doing tasks that are <strong>37</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Creativity</p><p>An advertising campaign for a <strong>38</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> was memorable but failed to boost sales.</p><p>Creativity should be used as a response to a particular <strong>39</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Excellence</p><p>According to one study, on average, pioneers had a <strong>40</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> that was far higher than that of followers.</p><p>Companies that always aim at excellence may miss opportunities.</p></div></div>",
